NOTICE

Marketing Council is an adaptation of the llm-council skill
(https://github.com/tenfoldmarc/llm-council-skill), which is MIT licensed, and
of the LLM Council methodology described by Andrej Karpathy
(https://x.com/karpathy/status/1962263486196867115).

Derived from that prior work:
  - the council structure
  - blind peer review with randomised anonymisation
  - chairman synthesis of the reviewed responses

Added by this project:
  - the six-advisor marketing roster, arranged in three opposing pairs
  - the intake gate and its nine required plan components
  - numeric 1-10 scoring per advisor dimension
  - the 20% budget reallocation round
  - the measurement gate
  - the four-way GO / GO WITH CHANGES / REWORK / KILL verdict
